#: ../../../users/custom-upgrades.rst:2
msgid "Custom Upgrade Server"
msgstr "自訂升級伺服器"

#: ../../../users/custom-upgrades.rst:4
msgid ""
"Syncthing by default upgrades automatically from the `official release "
"packages <https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing/releases>`__ on GitHub. If "
"this is unsuitable, Syncthing can instead be configured to look for upgrades "
"on a local or private upgrade server."
msgstr ""
"Syncthing 預設會從 GitHub 上的 `官方發行套件 <https://github.com/syncthing/"
"syncthing/releases>`__ 自動升級。若此方式不適用，也可將 Syncthing 設定為到本"
"機或私有升級伺服器檢查更新。"

#: ../../../users/custom-upgrades.rst:11
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方式"

#: ../../../users/custom-upgrades.rst:13
msgid ""
"The URL used to fetch release information can be set in :ref:`advanced`, "
"under the name ``releasesURL``. The URL should point to a location serving a "
"valid release list. The release list is a JSON file on the following format::"
msgstr ""
"用來取得發行資訊的 URL 可在 :ref:`advanced` 中以 ``releasesURL`` 名稱設定。"
"該 URL 應指向可提供有效發行清單的位置。發行清單為以下格式的 JSON 檔案::"

